## Next Steps for the User

### 1. Enable Speed Insights in Vercel Dashboard
To start collecting performance data:
1. Go to your Vercel project dashboard: https://vercel.com/dashboard
2. Select your project (`abdullhamid-fayad-portfolio`)
3. Navigate to "Speed Insights" in the sidebar
4. Click the "Enable" button

### 2. Deploy or Push Changes
The Speed Insights implementation is already in production. If you make new changes:
- Push to your connected Git repository (automatic deployment)
- Or run `vercel deploy` manually

### 3. View Performance Metrics
After deployment and user visits:
- Access the Speed Insights dashboard in your Vercel project
- View real-time Core Web Vitals data
- Analyze performance trends over time
- Identify pages that need optimization

